1
00:00:00,599 --> 00:00:04,123
Shit… I've never felt like this before.

2
00:00:04,123 --> 00:00:07,465
Why the hell am I
worrying about you this much?

3
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,765
Karn…

4
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:19,059
When you hugged me…
what were you thinking?

5
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:25,400
When you ask like that…
what the hell are *you* thinking?

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,385
Karn…

7
00:00:26,385 --> 00:00:33,841
Fine—I thought… I thought you were cute.
I thought you were nice to hold.

8
00:00:34,534 --> 00:00:36,397
I don't know…

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,034
why the hell I'm like this…

10
00:00:44,039 --> 00:00:45,582
Do you… like me?

11
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:51,779
“Like” in the way you mean—
what does that even mean?

12
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,694
You know exactly what I mean.

13
00:00:55,817 --> 00:00:59,017
I don't know.

14
00:00:59,017 --> 00:01:01,055
Do you have feelings for me or not?

15
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,734
If you don't, then you have
no right to be jealous of me.

16
00:01:08,628 --> 00:01:12,854
Whether I work part-time,
go out, or sleep with someone—

17
00:01:13,409 --> 00:01:14,834
—that's my business, right?

18
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,765
Then what do I have to do?
What the hell do I need to do…

19
00:01:19,474 --> 00:01:21,530
…to have the right to call you mine?

20
00:01:22,917 --> 00:01:24,002
Answer me.

21
00:01:26,606 --> 00:01:28,221
Go ask yourself that first.

22
00:01:31,796 --> 00:01:33,046
Earth…
